			"notes": "This release fixes several bugs, and adds a proper license and attribution.\n\nAutomotons now properly restart a broadcast after saving and loading, and broadcasting automotons with no modules no longer crash the game (and are completely ignored by receivers). Broadcasts stop if an automoton's head is switched with one that can't support a broadcast.\n\nAutomotons now start and finish modules on separate ticks, which should prevent ghost blocks and such from appearing and makes moved blocks actually exist."
		},
