			"notes": "This is the first full release of Automotons, which polishes several preexisting features.\n\nThis release contains new textures for Automotons (courtesy of BoundaryBreaker!), new advancements, sounds for Automoton head usage, indicators for broadcasts, a Finnish translation (courtesy of Sigma-One!), improvements to the Blocklayer head, and a single bugfix."
